# Contributing to [[.Name]]

## Development

Canonical commands (also in root `AGENTS.md` and `docs/commands.md`):

```bash
gofmt -w .
go test -count=1 ./...
go vet ./...
go tool staticcheck ./...
```

## Pull requests

- Keep changes focused; prefer deleting unused scaffolding over abstraction.
- Do not add vendor-specific agent instruction files that override `AGENTS.md`.
- CI must stay green on the single required Linux job before merge.

## Releases

See [`docs/releasing.md`](docs/releasing.md). Publication requires an
owner-added and reviewed license; Foundry does not generate licenses.
